---
import Layout from '../layouts/Article.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, CONTACT_PHONE } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
	title="About Gravitaz"
	description="An independent enterprise architecture practice. Who you would be working with, and how to get in touch."
	heroImage="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg"
>
	<p>
		Gravitaz Ltd is an independent enterprise architecture practice, working as an interim and
		fractional architecture lead on digital and eCommerce transformation.
	</p>
	<p>
		The work is done by Tim Holmes. Engagements are led and delivered personally — there is no bench
		and no handover to a delivery team you have not met.
	</p>

	<h2>Background</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>TOGAF 9 Certified — The Open Group, 2015</li>
		<li>MSc Database and Information Systems — Birkbeck College, University of London</li>
		<li>BSc (Hons) Computer Science — Brunel University, Uxbridge</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		Around thirty engagements across retail, eCommerce, telecoms, publishing, education, life
		sciences and fintech — <a href="/engagements">written up individually here</a>. A
		<a href="/Tim_Holmes_Detailed_CV.md">detailed CV</a> is also available.
	</p>

	<h2>Contact</h2>
	<p>
		<strong>Email</strong> <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a><br />
		<strong>Phone</strong> <a href={`tel:${CONTACT_PHONE.replace(/\s/g, '')}`}>{CONTACT_PHONE}</a><br
		/>
		<strong>Location</strong> United Kingdom — willing to travel
	</p>
	<p>
		Also on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/holmestm/" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a> and
		<a href="https://github.com/holmestm" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
	</p>
	<p>
		Initial conversations are free, and usually the fastest way to work out whether the practice is
		a fit for the problem.
	</p>
</Layout>
